  {
    "episode_id": 70869,
    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/7/0/70869.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 1,
    "turn_text": "Of course, there are a lot of problems with our president, but I haven't heard anyone argue that he's really there for the right reasons, that he is really trying to do the right thing for the country. I mean, many people who voted for him say, oh, well, he's going to shake things up or whatnot and try to upend the system. I don't think anybody looks at our president and says, oh, there's a model of selfless service.",
