    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/7/0/70869.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 252,
    "turn_text": "I know that you're focused on this year. Let's just talk a little bit about what the future might hold for you. Massachusetts are two Senate seats, both of them are held by people who I don't think most people expect to go out of those Senate seats unless Elizabeth Warren is elected president anytime soon. There's a governor's race this year, but depending on how that goes, then there might be an opening in 2022. There definitely will be an election, might be an open seat. Is any of that interesting to you?",
