        "confidence": 0.94
      },
      {
        "text": "My primary motivation is serving my country.",
        "confidence": 0.93
      },
      {
        "text": "I focus on where I can have the greatest impact.",
        "confidence": 0.93
      },
      {
        "text": "I am open to alternative ways to serve if they prove more effective.",
        "confidence": 0.92
