    "turn_idx": 280,
    "turn_text": "Anyway, the point is that there are a lot of real problems that everyday Americans face right now. And we're not doing enough to change that. And we have an opportunity in 2018 by winning back the House. And I think it's the right thing to do for our country. But we're not going to win if we're not willing to look ourselves in the mirror as Democrats and recognize that we lost election after election. We can't keep doing the same old thing where we just seem to be throwing the same old solutions and the same old, the same, you know, which is already existing leadership, but really new problems that are facing our country. And that's not working. But the exciting thing is there's a new generation of Democrats coming who I think can make a change.",
    "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_02",
